WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.400
This is Mailtodo, from JK Multi Gmail MCP. One local board for the work hiding in your Gmail accounts.

2
00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:14.400
It turns recent inbox mail into tasks, sorted by status and by account.

3
00:00:14.400 --> 00:00:19.533
Replies you still owe, with subjects and due dates, all in one place.

4
00:00:19.533 --> 00:00:25.533
Invoice amounts and due dates to double check. Mailtodo never makes payments.

5
00:00:25.533 --> 00:00:31.400
Filters and stats show progress per account. Every screen here uses sample data.

6
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:39.300
The board asks for Gmail read-only access, encrypts its data on your PC, and sends nothing to external AI.
